    </nav>
    <p style="font-size:0.65rem;letter-spacing:0.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#e00;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Bulk Clothing Manufacturer | Since 1998 | Wholesale Pricing</p>
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);font-weight:200;color:#fff;margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.2;">
      Bulk Clothing Manufacturer for Wholesalers and Retailers
