      <span class="section-label">Production Scale</span>
      <div class="accent-line"></div>
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.4rem);font-weight:300;color:#fff;margin-bottom:1rem;">Large Quantity Production</h2>
